              <td>Move, scale, and rotate an element without affecting the layout of others.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="name">Reflow vs. repaint</td>
              <td>CSS</td>
              <td>Layout changes cause expensive reflows; color changes repaint; transform and opacity only composite.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="name">SCSS / Sass</td>
              <td>CSS</td>
